{"product_id":"to-your-eternity-9","title":"To Your Eternity 9","description":"\u003cp\u003eA new manga from the creator of the acclaimed A Silent Voice, featuring intimate, emotional drama and an epic story spanning time and space...Prince Bon's ability to see the dead convinces him that he is all-powerful--until he finds himself trapped at the hands of The Church of Bennett. Meanwhile, there are abilities within Fushi that only Bon can see, but are such latent powers even necessary for a being like Fushi? As the fated Prince Bon awaits his judgment, he must make a decision for the sake of his friends and his people.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 147 x 208\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Oima Yoshitoki\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781632367341\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45841446928537,"sku":"Manga-A-39781632367341","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69024ecd3397a_91Pnl8kJUDL._AC_UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1761759464","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/to-your-eternity-9","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}